.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Nazo is a kitsune, one of the Japanese fox spirits
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]notorious for tricking and toying with mortals. She
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]keeps her distance from other kitsune, though,
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]because she won't follow their traditions: she
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]reveals what she is without a second thought, and
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]her interest in people goes past simply fooling
.L 107.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]them — she truly wants to understand them, and
.L 117.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]some say she envies them. With shapeshifting,
.L 127.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]illusions, and curses she devises intricate schemes
.L 137.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]to test what her targets believe in, and leaves them
.L 147.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]be only once her curiosity is satisfied.
.CP
.SH
\&Nazo: Attacks
.PP
\&Fox Fire: Nazo dazzles the opponent with a brilliant illusionary display before overwhelming them with spiritual power.
.SH
\&Nazo: Character Hooks
.PP
\&Equally at home as a fox, a child, or a beautiful woman, Nazo can fit alongside almost any character, and one of her carefully plotted schemes could fill a whole adventure. She could also be the "old bag" from Daisuke's background or the evil spirit from Cora's.
